@startuml
title Fortius AS-IS · C4 nivel 4 · Escritura de registro
caption Propósito: representar funciones y tipos reales del flujo PUT [E03,E04]
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #17334F
skinparam BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
class "api/admin/collections/[collection]/[id]/route.ts" as route <<module>> {
 PUT(request, context)
}
class "backend/http.ts" as http <<module>> {
 apiResponse(...)
 assertSameOrigin(request)
 readJson(request)
}
class "backend/auth.ts" as auth <<module>> {
 requireStaff()
 createServerClient(accessToken?, privileged?)
}
class "backend/repository.ts" as repo <<module>> {
 putRecord(client, collection, id, input): Promise<StoredRecord>
}
class "backend/validation.ts" as validation <<module>> {
 parseCollection(...)
 parseWrite(...)
 parseRecord(...)
}
class "backend/contracts.ts" as contracts <<module>> {
 StoredRecord
}
class "SupabaseClient" as client <<SDK>> {
 rpc(name, parameters)
}
class "fortius_inmuebles_put_record" as rpc <<SQL function>>
route --> http : envuelve/valida petición
route --> auth : requireStaff()
route --> repo : putRecord()
repo --> validation : normaliza y valida
repo ..> contracts : retorno tipado
repo --> client : client.rpc(...)
client --> rpc : HTTPS / PostgREST
note bottom of rpc
 Control de versión, integridad y persistencia.
 No es una clase TypeScript.
end note
legend bottom
CONFIRMADO: módulos/funciones existentes; cajas module no representan clases instanciables.
Flecha continua = invocación; discontinua = dependencia de tipo.
endlegend
@enduml
